## Phase 0 changes

- Corrected the panel integration test to check `StringSelectMenuBuilder.toJSON()` rather than assuming `builder.data.options` exists. The production panel behavior was not changed; the test now validates the serialized Discord API component format and checks event labels as well as values.
- Added `REPORTED_SCREENSHOT_REPORT_PATH` support in the reported-screenshot runner so future OCR experiments can preserve historical baseline results.
- Created a baseline report and preserved fresh fallback results under `testdata/phase0-baseline/`.
- Rebuilt the Phase 0 candidate without bundled `node_modules`; dependency installation is performed with the lockfile instead.

