**Phase 0 baseline reconciliation is complete, but the Tesseract.js fallback is not production-ready.** It starts and completes all four baseline jobs, but exact-field accuracy is 0/4 and the reported screenshot's damage remains incorrect. The new Phase 0 package fixes the baseline test harness and packaging issues; it does not claim to fix the OCR mismatches or the historical timeout concern.
